# 3. Model Metrics
val_acc = accuracy_score(y_val, y_val_pred)
val_f1 = f1_score(y_val, y_val_pred, average='weighted')
val_auc = roc_auc_score(y_val, y_val_probs) if y_val_probs is not None else "N/A"

# 4. Construct Model-vs-Baseline Comparison Table
# (Replace Week 4 baseline values with your actual recorded baseline numbers)
